{"id":"2aef4b22374aba29","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization.md","title":"有界归纳推出有界最小数原理","display":"thm-i-delta-zero-minimization — 有界归纳推出有界最小数原理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization","aliases":["72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization"],"display":"thm-i-delta-zero-minimization — 有界归纳推出有界最小数原理","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]","[[72-df-i-delta-0]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §1.2.6 Theorem, print86/PDF98; source proof read","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-i-delta-zero-minimization — 有界归纳推出有界最小数原理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d506b73ecaab7431\" href=\"?note=d506b73ecaab7431\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection\">72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §1.2.6 Theorem, print86/PDF98; source proof read"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta^0_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta^0_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A)\\)</span> 使用已给定的新鲜变量选择和全称闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\Delta_0\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反证若 A 有见证却没有最小见证，则每次 A(y) 成立都有更小 A 见证。对有界公式“所有 z&lt;y 都不满足 A(z)”作完全归纳：零时真；若它在 y 真而 A(y) 真，无最小性给更小见证矛盾；故推进到下一个 y。这个完全归纳可由对有界初段全称公式的普通有界归纳得到，与源页给出的证明相同。所有自由参数经 ucl 封闭。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection","status":"resolved","id":"d506b73ecaab7431","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\Delta^0_0","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MIN}_x(A)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\De